{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T14:13:21.766Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"5380d4700eae14de72b74828","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T14:13:21.766Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-12T14:13:21.766Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","text":"Claimed. Plan: implement src/rules.ts exporting RULES (PML001-PML010) with RuleContext; test with real SDK trackers via test/helpers.ts tracker(t); adjust only pure metadata for boundary timestamps/arrays. Choices: PML005 default staleDays=14 via parameters; PML004 evidence fields resolution/actual_result/close_reason/close comments; PML008 normalized title-vs-description/note equality."}]}],"before_hash":"c78234abbfba168dad350a4c0e8471e25afab9ceb7e0cb9e5e3b30fe3c94e766","after_hash":"a45b29d53ea362a876efc48390923ef5c08d7c25a255d597bfce454646ab678b","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"9388745501e1d64c0eca0185db3d880799dc610dbb194ad525af8d5a5edb11db"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T14:21:15.952Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"5380d4700eae14de72b74828","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T14:21:15.952Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","text":"Rule semantics chosen for the four unspecified slots: PML001 warn description: blank description on non-terminal items. PML002 error assignee: in_progress without assignee and claim_principal. PML006 info acceptance_criteria: missing on open/in_progress/blocked (drafts and terminal excluded). PML007 warn deadline: deadline in the past on non-terminal items, absent or invalid deadlines ignored. PML003: when a title lists criteria via semicolon/newline, each criterion needs an observable verb or explicit condition; works/done-only criteria and duplicated criteria are bad; a title identical to another item is bad. PML009: blocked items need a blocked_reason AND a local non-self blocker ref (blocked_by or blocked_by-kind dependency matching another item id); prose/URLs never count. PML005 counts updated_at plus comment, note, linked-test provenance and test-run timestamps as activity."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T14:21:15.952Z"}],"before_hash":"a45b29d53ea362a876efc48390923ef5c08d7c25a255d597bfce454646ab678b","after_hash":"f70165d64bb46a81a29a4abb1cd94fb1bf4e5c3cb7012a02828a49381a573eef","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e187e93f5e55b739815f57e0c67b66d20c9b14a712bd75d54512389c8ad24175"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T14:29:47.687Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"8e50ed6ddba2b59987db529b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T14:29:47.687Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","text":"Rule contract correction absorbed: prior delegation lacked the original definitions and tested wrong semantics (PML001 description, PML002 ownership, PML006 criteria, PML007 deadline). Orchestrator-corrected contract now under test: PML001 vague/placeholder title; PML002 open/in_progress Feature/Issue/Task without acceptance criteria; PML003 unverifiable criteria with semicolon/newline splits; PML004 closed without closure evidence (close-time or labeled comments only, invalid closed_at cannot infer); PML005 stale in_progress and stale claims (default 14 days, exactly-14 not flagged); PML006 Feature without linked files or tests; PML007 childless Epic over the whole corpus with scalar parent and both SDK hierarchy alias directions; PML008 description/notes only restating the title; PML009 blocked without reason or with unresolvable local blocker reference (prose and URLs valid); PML010 pure SDK duplicate membership."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T14:29:47.687Z"}],"before_hash":"f70165d64bb46a81a29a4abb1cd94fb1bf4e5c3cb7012a02828a49381a573eef","after_hash":"5aab62f2f764b3128ccedde22059c0bfe990c275f49e06ae2743d7191fa489fb","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7abd91c10f8bbe55a38db0e10274f3f5c153471fda6e320a4578a14ca8c51c22"}
